  "id": "intergroup-conflict",
  "term": "intergroup conflict",
  "definition": "Intergroup conflict is conflict between social groups in which another group is seen as an adversary. In psychological terms, it can become tied to collective identity and be harder to reduce when the other group is perceived as a rival.",
